  "raw": ", combustion-free XC40 debuted yesterday, and the picture that came up is one of the cleanest, most modern SUVs on the planet. Volvo promises a range of around 300 miles on a single charge, so that the worst of the emissions problem is solved well before you run out of juice. And if you’re worried, Volvo promises full carbon-neutrality by 2040. Volvo and Volvo North America why didn’t you tell us?\nIt’s all thanks to this nifty engine, a four-cylinder plug-in hybrid system that “is the product of extensive research in cooperation with universities, magazines and customers.” A proprietary battery pack that packs enough power to give you 400 miles of range and lasting pleasure on a full charge. And didn’t you just love Volvo’s announcement that no diesel engine will be produced under its own name?\nAll Lyft, All Fall\nTo celebrate the rollouts for Lyft,",
  "serialized": ", combustion-free XC40 debuted yesterday, and the picture that came up is one of the cleanest, most modern SUVs on the planet. Volvo promises a range of around 300 miles on a single charge, so that the worst of the emissions problem is solved well before you run out of juice. And if you’re worried, Volvo promises full carbon-neutrality by 2040. Volvo and Volvo North America why didn’t you tell us? It’s all thanks to this nifty engine, a four-cylinder plug-in hybrid system that “is the product of extensive research in cooperation with universities, magazines and customers.” A proprietary battery pack that packs enough power to give you 400 miles of range and lasting pleasure on a full charge. And didn’t you just love Volvo’s announcement that no diesel engine will be produced under its own name? All Lyft, All Fall To celebrate the rollouts for Lyft,",
